; Adapted source: pinned Mathlib Ideal/Defs.lean, Ideal/Operations.lean
; and Affine/Point.lean. All ideal closures are checked proofs.
; Generated by scripts/generate-flt-ideals.py; checked native terms.
; Ideal multiplication is the checked span of
; products of actual input members, each carrying membership/equality
; witnesses. Prove its universal property from span minimality,
; with no multiplication or finite-generation oracle.
